WEBVTT

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.320
At last, the unification of 
dimensions was triggered,

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:12.190
and the Synchro, Xyz, Standard, and 
Fusion Dimensions began to unite.

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:15.660
While that happened, Kaito and I

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.200
saw Yuya and the others take the 
form of the devil duelist, Z-ARC.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.040
Field Spell Crossover.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.750
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:45.060
Take care of the rest... You two, from Xyz...

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:54.740
Bring back Yuya... no matter what.

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:04.630
You two are next, then?

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:09.880
Let's go. That form doesn't suit you.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:11.160
Come back to us.

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:13.020
My turn!

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:19.720
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:23.400
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:27.300
Their dragons call to each other,

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:30.580
almost as if seeking one another.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:08.970
Supreme King Dragon of Rebellion

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:16.040
A human fused with a monster?

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:17.680
What kind of joke is this?

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:24.080
Sora and Edo believed

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:29.820
that part of Yuya, however faint it 
may be, remained in him.

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:33.020
Then we'll carry on their intentions!

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:37.230
We'll take back Yuya and Ute.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:41.470
I summon Raidraptor — King 
Lanius from my hand!

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:47.720
I activate King Lanius's monster effect.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:52.190
Once per turn, I can Special Summon 
one Raidraptor from my hand

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:53.860
of Level 4 or below.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:58.680
I choose to summon Raidraptor — Vanishing Lanius.

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:07.080
And in addition, when a Vanishing Lanius exists on my side of the field,

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:11.130
I can Special Summon Raidraptor
 — Fuzzy Lanius from my hand!

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:21.660
I overlay Level 4 King Lanius, 
Vanishing Lanius, and Fuzzy Lanius!

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:30.220
Hidden falcon, raise your sharpened 
claws from adversity

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:33.180
and show your wings of rebellion!

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:35.320
Xyz Summon!

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:40.890
Appear, Rank 4 Raidraptor — Rise Falcon!

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:46.860
I get to face Xyz users now?

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:48.000
Interesting!

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:55.210
I overlay the two Level 4 Darkwurms 
on my side of the field!

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:57.290
What? During my turn...

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:58.610
...he Xyz Summoned?

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:01.870
When I exist on my own field

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:07.820
and you summon an Xyz Monster, 
I can also Xyz Summon.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:12.220
Fangs of rebellion that live in black darkness...

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:16.160
Yield to me and serve me!

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:17.860
Xyz Summon!

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:22.730
Rank 4 Supreme King Dragon Dark Rebellion!

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:26.540
Dark Rebellion?

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:28.040
There's no doubt in my mind.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:30.860
Ute still exists somewhere inside him.

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:36.720
I activate Rise Falcon's effect!

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:39.450
I use one Overlay Unit

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:43.820
to add the attack points of all monsters 
Special Summoned to your field

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:46.220
to those of Rise Falcon.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.800
6600 attack points.

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:55.770
More than Supreme King Z-ARC's!

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.670
Do you remember, Ute?

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:04.740
When I was running rampant 
in the Standard Dimension,

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:08.650
you stopped me with a single punch.

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:12.020
So, Ute...

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:17.690
This time, when you've lost yourself, 
I'll bring you back with this one hit.

00:06:18.030 --> 00:06:18.890
Battle!

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:23.600
Raidraptor — Rise Falcon attacks 
Supreme King Dragon Z-ARC!

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:26.560
Flame Claw Evolution!

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:29.800
Open your eyes, Yuya! Ute!

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:33.270
Supreme King Dragon Dark 
Rebellion's effect activates!

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:37.360
When Dark Rebellion is on my side of the field,

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:41.150
you cannot attack any other Xyz Monsters!

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:49.890
Supreme King Z-ARC is comprised 
of all four summoning methods.

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:52.860
He is an Xyz Monster, too.

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:56.270
So he can't be attacked.

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:57.900
Edo! Sora!

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.770
Gonny... Sawatari, too.

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:06.750
You okay?

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:07.740
Sorry.

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:10.300
What happened?

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:12.710
Tell me everything!

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:16.680
Then, I attack Supreme King 
Dragon Dark Rebellion.

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:20.390
I also activate Supreme King Dragon 
Dark Rebellion's other effect!

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:25.320
I use one Overlay Unit to render one 
of your monsters' attack points

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:32.900
0 until the end of the turn, and add 
that amount to its own!

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.440
The attack points are reversed.

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:45.270
I activate my Quick-Play Spell 
Overlay Burst Armor!

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:49.900
By removing all of Rise Falcon's Overlay Units,

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:55.050
I negate Rise Falcon's destruction by 
battle, as well as all battle damage.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:58.840
I guess it won't be that easy to get to him.

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:01.370
But I still have an idea.

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:05.220
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:11.800
With this, Supreme King Dark 
Rebellion's effect ends,

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:14.730
and its attack points return to normal.

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:17.740
Rise Falcon's effect ends.

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:19.690
Its attack points return to normal.

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:21.850
My turn!

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:27.550
Draw!

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:31.610
I summon Cipher Wing from my hand!

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:38.380
While Cipher Wing is on my side of the field,

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:41.990
I can Special Summon another 
Cipher Wing from my hand.

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:48.840
And I activate my Continuous 
Spell Double Exposure.

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:52.620
I double the levels of my Cipher Wings!

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:58.790
And I overlay my two Level 8 Cipher Wings!

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:07.800
Galaxy shining in the darkness...

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:11.110
Dwell within the god of vengeance 
and become my servant!

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:13.000
Xyz Summon!

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:18.500
Descend, Rank 8 Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon!

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:25.190
Yuya Sakaki...

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:30.150
The man who communicated through duels, 
and stopped Heartland's invasion.

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:34.120
If you and Ute still exist,

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:37.090
then it is our turn to communicate with our duels!

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:40.010
But as long as Dark Rebellion exists,

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:43.930
its monster effect will prevent attacks 
against Supreme King Z-ARC.

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.230
In that case,

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:47.790
I will steal it and borrow its power

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:51.470
to get my feelings through to him!

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:57.440
I use one of Galaxy-Eyes Cipher 
Dragon's Overlay Units

00:09:57.440 --> 00:09:59.040
to activate its monster effect!

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:02.960
Once per turn, until my End Phase,

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:07.490
I can take control of one monster on your 
side of the field, with its effect negated!

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:11.630
I take control of Dark Rebellion,

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:13.960
and treat it as a Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:16.550
Cipher Projection!

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:21.390
Behold my power!

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:24.140
Monsters on my side of the field

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:29.010
cannot be affected by effects from your 
Synchro, Fusion, or Xyz Monsters!

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:29.770
What?

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:30.940
Impossible!

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:34.150
Unaffected by effects?

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:38.850
Then if I attack, Dark Rebellion's effect 
will turn the tables back on me.

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:43.280
Then, the only option remaining 
to destroy Dark Rebellion

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:45.850
and get my feelings through to 
Yuya and the others...

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:48.260
It's this!

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:52.310
I set three cards and end my turn.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.810
Back to where we started?

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:23.850
Brother!

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:25.760
This way.

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:42.330
The merging of the dimensions 
is growing more severe.

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:45.000
What's wrong, Layra?

00:11:55.320 --> 00:11:57.260
G-Ghosts...

00:11:57.530 --> 00:11:59.440
Where are we?

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:01.730
Isn't this Heartland?

00:12:02.060 --> 00:12:04.030
I was in City before...

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:07.540
They aren't ghosts.

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:10.810
They're the residents of the Xyz 
and Synchro Dimensions.

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:14.980
The dimensional unification 
must be causing this, too.

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:25.060
Sayaka, this way! Hurry!

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:26.520
What are you doing?

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:28.530
Look! I see Syun!

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:34.730
Look, Kaito's with him.

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:38.790
Sayaka! Run!

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:03.590
Where are we?

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:11.690
Kaito!

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:12.600
Syun!

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:15.070
Sayaka! Allen!

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:16.830
What are they doing here?

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:18.040
It's coming, Syun!

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:20.510
My turn!

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:26.850
I attack Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon with 
Supreme King Dragon Dark Rebellion!

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:34.230
I activate Supreme King Dragon 
Dark Rebellion's effect.

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:39.660
I use one Overlay Unit to 
reduce the attack points

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:43.530
of one opponent monster to 0,

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:49.460
and add them to those of Dark Rebellion 
until this turn's End Phase!

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:54.010
Look out, Syun!

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:55.750
Don't falter!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.680
I won't be ended here...

00:13:58.680 --> 00:14:02.490
Not until I get our feelings 
through to Yuya and Ute.

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:07.460
Quick-Play Spell Rank-Up-Magic Devotion Force!

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:10.350
When a monster attacks during my opponent's turn,

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:13.930
I can activate it, targeting one Xyz 
Monster on my side of the field.

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:21.340
It lets me Xyz Summon a Raidraptor 
of one level higher.

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:30.400
Ferocious falcon, cut through fierce 
battles and flap your wings

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:32.250
to defeat your enemies!

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:35.950
Rank Up Xyz Change! Appear!

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:39.290
Rank 5 Raidraptor — Blaze Falcon!

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:46.330
Wait for us, Yuya. Ute.

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:50.300
With this duel, I will get our 
feelings through to you.

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:55.770
Quick-Play Spell Rank-Up-Magic 
Limit Over Force!

00:14:56.680 --> 00:15:00.240
When a Special Summon happens on an 
opponent's field via Rank-Up-Magic,

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:06.220
I can halve my life points to activate this 
spell, targeting one of my Xyz Monsters!

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:14.190
I Xyz Summon a monster of one rank higher.

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:19.400
Galaxy shining in the darkness...

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:24.840
Release your eternal light 
to guide us to the future.

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:30.540
Descend, Rank 9 Neo 
Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon!

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:35.510
The attack points of a monster Xyz 
Summoned with Limit Over Force

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:40.260
are multiplied by the number of 
Rank-Up-Magics used up till now.

00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:45.190
Thus, Neo Galaxy-Eyes's 
attack points are doubled!

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:49.790
I activate another Quick-Play Spell.

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:53.630
Rank-Up-Magic Limit Over Force!

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:58.100
When a Rank-Up-Magic is activated 
on an opponent's field,

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:01.470
I can halve my life points to activate this spell,

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:04.080
targeting one Xyz Monster on my field!

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:12.250
I Xyz Summon a monster of one rank higher.

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:22.270
Proud falcon, flap your wings that are 
stained with the blood of heroes,

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:24.900
and travel the path of revolution!

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:28.100
Rank Up Xyz Change!

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:33.640
Appear, Rank 6 Raidraptor — Revolution Falcon!

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:43.370
The attack points of a monster Xyz Summoned
 with Limit Over Force are multiplied by the

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:48.020
number of Rank-Up-Magics used 
until the turn's End Phase.

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:51.760
Which means Revolution Falcon's 
attack points are tripled!

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.430
Wow.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:07.100
Kaito activated Rank-Up-Magic Limit 
Over Force off of Syun's Rank-Up.

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:11.580
Then, since Kaito used Limit Over Force,

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:16.550
Syun could use Limit Over Force 
to rank up once more!

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:19.770
They didn't even have to discuss it.

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:22.250
That's Syun and Kaito for you.

00:17:25.530 --> 00:17:27.690
Listen to my voice, Ute!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.160
Listen to my voice, Yuya!

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:33.720
I activate my Continuous Trap Rank-Up Gravity!

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:38.590
When there's a ranked-up Xyz 
Monster on my side of the field,

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:42.110
your monsters can only attack ranked-up monsters.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:46.840
If you do not attack, when Battle Phase 
ends, your monster is banished!

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:48.680
Yes, perfect!

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:52.620
Neo Galaxy-Eyes and Revolution 
Falcon both have

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:55.150
more attack points than his monsters.

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:57.720
Keep fighting, Syun! Kaito!

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:09.900
Is this all the power you had?

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:14.370
I activate Supreme King Dragon 
Dark Rebellion's effect!

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:21.050
I return it to my Extra Deck, to Special Summon 
two Darkwurms from my deck.

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:27.820
And I set the attack points of Xyz 
Monsters on your field to 0!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:33.860
What?

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:36.780
Set their attack points to 0?

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:37.830
How can he do that?

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.970
Kaito! Syun!

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:48.090
You're telling me that's Yuya?

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:49.520
Yeah.

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:54.480
We tried to bring Yuya back with a duel, but...

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:57.000
Sawatari, watch over them!

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:58.090
O-Okay.

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.460
That sound...

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:08.040
This ends now.

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.860
View losing to me as an honor

00:19:10.860 --> 00:19:11.900
and die!

00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:17.320
I attack Revolution Falcon

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:22.810
and Neo Galaxy-Eyes Cipher 
Dragon with my Darkwurms!

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:32.450
I activate Action Spell Miracle!

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:35.420
I activate Action Spell Evasion!

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:40.620
You think such tricks will work against me?

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:42.720
By my own power,

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:46.560
I negate cards acquired in a phase 
other than the Draw Phase,

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:48.600
and destroy them!

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.060
Even Action Cards...

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:00.740
This duel...

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:03.450
I'll take it on!

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:09.890
Jack Atlas!

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:14.290
Let us begin.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:20.000
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:29.140
So, a few more have risen to challenge me.

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:32.110
I have no further use for you.

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:35.310
Begone from my sight!

00:20:45.990 --> 00:20:49.230
Kurosaki! Kaito!

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:57.380
Forgive me, Sora Shiunin...

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:04.810
Gongenzaka, here.

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:07.160
Take this.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:08.280
Isn't this...

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:11.250
Yuya's...

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:13.840
I leave the rest to you.

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:19.190
The man Gongenzaka will handle it.

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:28.770
That looks like Yuya.

00:21:29.070 --> 00:21:33.740
Yeah. They fell in the effort 
to recover Yuya's heart.

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:40.210
The devil duelist composed of 
Yuya and the four dragons,

00:21:40.210 --> 00:21:42.230
Supreme King Z-ARC.

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:48.190
But if any part of Yuya's heart 
remains, no matter how faint,

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:51.660
I will recover it!

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:53.660
Wait for me, Yuya!

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:56.130
We are going to save you!

00:21:58.510 --> 00:22:01.320
I'm counting on you, Jack... Gongenzaka.

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:03.330
Fight the battle I can't!

00:22:04.100 --> 00:22:05.960
Supreme King Z-ARC!

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:09.670
We two will now face you.

00:23:48.950 --> 00:23:51.730
Foolish Synchro users,

00:23:51.730 --> 00:23:55.610
learn that the moment you summoned 
Synchro Monsters before me,

00:23:55.610 --> 00:23:59.920
it was all over.

00:23:59.920 --> 00:24:04.290
You mean he can Synchro Summon 
from this position without a Tuner?

00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:06.910
Retainer of mine with wings of light,

00:24:06.910 --> 00:24:09.660
strike the enemy with your keen wings!

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:14.200
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Dragon With Dark Wings.

00:24:14.660 --> 00:24:16.950
The fun is only getting started!
